[33.896126, "o", "\r\r\nLast login: Fri Sep  4 12:11:20 2026 from 187.14.56.174\r\r\r\n       __       ______   _______    ________  ______\r\r\n      /_/\\     /_____/\\ /______/\\  /_______/\\/_____/\\\r\r\n      \\:\\ \\    \\:::_ \\ \\\\::::__\\/__\\__.::._\\/\\:::__\\/\r\r\n       \\:\\ \\    \\:\\ \\ \\ \\\\:\\ /____/\\  \\::\\ \\  \\:\\ \\  __\r\r\n        \\:\\ \\____\\:\\ \\ \\ \\\\:\\\\_  _\\/  _\\::\\ \\__\\:\\ \\/_/\\\r\r\n         \\:\\/___/\\\\:\\_\\ \\ \\\\:\\_\\ \\ \\ /__\\::\\__/\\\\:\\_\\ \\ \\\r\r\n          \\_____\\/ \\_____\\/ \\_____\\/ \\________\\/ \\_____\\/\r\r\n\r\r\n        Welcome to the Logic Wargame on Smash The Stack\r\r\n\r\r\n              Developers:  mh, level, zoidberg, frank^2\r\r\n\r\r\n         Please email staff@smashthestack.org for help\r\r\n\r\r\n                   Levels are in /levels/\r\r\n                Passes are located in ~/.pass\r\r\n\r\r\n        Join us on IRC in #logic at irc.smashthestack.org\r\r\n\r\r\n=================================================================\r\r\n     Anything in /tmp older than 30 days will automatically\r\r\n    be cleaned up. Please keep this in mind while doing your\r\r\n                     work and taking breaks.\r\r\n\r\r\nRules:\r\r\n        * NO rooting the box\r\r\n        * NO causing intentional damage to the system\r\r\n        * NO outbound connections\r\r\n        * All code belongs in /tmp/your_directory\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b]0;level2@logic:~\u0007[level2@logic ~]$ "]
